2026-07-27T09:45:22.9112795Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9113335Z i /tmp/RtmpM3POTG/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9113678Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9114076Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9114422Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9115209Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9116040Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:45:22.9117003Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
